:root{
  --void:#05070d;
  --deep:#080d17;
  --stone:#162033;
  --stone-2:#1d2a40;
  --ink:#efe6d3;
  --muted:#b6ac99;
  --dim:#7f7b70;
  --gold:#d9a54a;
  --gold-bright:#f4d08a;
  --gold-dark:#8a632a;
  --blood:#c6303c;
  --blood-bright:#ef5a62;
  --teal:#62e3cd;
  --violet:#a983ff;
  --display:"Palatino Linotype","Book Antiqua",Palatino,Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  --ui:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
}

*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%}
body{
  margin:0;
  background:var(--void);
  color:var(--ink);
  font-family:var(--ui);
  overflow:hidden;
  overscroll-behavior:none;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
  user-select:none;
  -webkit-user-select:none;
}
button{font:inherit;color:inherit}
.svg-defs{position:absolute;width:0;height:0;overflow:hidden}
svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}
.hidden{display:none!important}

#game{
  position:fixed;
  inset:0;
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  display:block;
  background:var(--void);
  touch-action:none;
}
body[data-mode="playing"] #game{cursor:none}
body.touch[data-mode="playing"] #game{cursor:default}
body.touch #game{touch-action:none}

.vignette{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:3;pointer-events:none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 46%,transparent 42%,rgba(2,4,8,.42) 78%,rgba(2,3,6,.86) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(2,4,8,.3),transparent 16%,transparent 82%,rgba(2,3,6,.52));
}
#flash{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:14;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 50%,rgba(198,32,44,0) 28%,rgba(198,32,44,.42) 100%);
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 130px 30px rgba(198,32,44,.34);
}
#flash.hurt{animation:hurtFlash .42s ease-out}
@keyframes hurtFlash{0%{opacity:1}100%{opacity:0}}

/* ---------- generic screen ---------- */
.screen{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:30;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:max(18px,env(safe-area-inset-top)) max(18px,env(safe-area-inset-right)) max(18px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom)) max(18px,env(safe-area-inset-left));
  overflow-y:auto;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 38%,rgba(9,14,24,.25) 0%,rgba(5,8,14,.62) 52%,rgba(3,5,9,.94) 100%);
}
.eyebrow{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;
  font-size:10px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:.38em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;
}
.eyebrow span{display:block;width:clamp(25px,5vw,60px);height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--gold-dark));}
.eyebrow span:last-child{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--gold-dark),transparent)}
.overlay-title{
  margin:12px 0 0;
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,70px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.09em;
  text-transform:uppercase;text-align:center;
  color:#f2e8d6;text-shadow:0 0 55px rgba(217,165,74,.22);
}
.overlay-title em{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold-bright)}
.overlay-sub{
  margin:12px 0 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);
  font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.035em;
}
kbd{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  min-width:20px;height:18px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:2px;
  border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.35);
  background:rgba(217,165,74,.08);color:var(--gold-bright);
  font-family:var(--ui);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;
  box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.4),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}

/* ---------- title ---------- */
#title-screen{
  align-items:center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%,rgba(10,16,27,.06) 0%,rgba(5,8,14,.55) 55%,rgba(3,5,9,.92) 100%);
}
.title-wrap{
  width:min(1120px,100%);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;
  gap:clamp(16px,2.4vh,30px);
  padding:clamp(10px,2vh,28px) 0 clamp(8px,2vh,20px);
}
.title-hero{text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:clamp(8px,1.4vh,16px)}
.title-hero h1{
  margin:0;
  font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(54px,8.8vw,112px);line-height:.82;letter-spacing:.055em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:#f4ecdc;
  text-shadow:0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.45),0 0 70px rgba(217,165,74,.2);
}
.title-hero h1 em{
  display:block;font-style:normal;color:var(--gold);
  letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:.83em;margin-top:.14em;
  text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(217,165,74,.32);
}
.tagline{
  margin:0;font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;
  color:var(--muted);font-size:clamp(13px,1.6vw,17px);letter-spacing:.06em;
}
.loadout{width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.section-label{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;
  color:#cabfa9;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.4em;text-transform:uppercase;
}
.section-label span{height:1px;width:min(90px,12vw);background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(217,165,74,.5))}
.section-label span:last-child{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(217,165,74,.5),transparent)}
.weapon-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(10px,1.2vw,16px)}
.weapon-card{
  position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;
  padding:clamp(12px,1.5vw,18px);
  text-align:left;cursor:pointer;
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 9%,transparent) 0%,transparent 52%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(25,35,53,.82),rgba(9,14,24,.94));
  border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.22);
  clip-path:polygon(0 12px,12px 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 12px),calc(100% - 12px) 100%,0 100%);
  transition:transform .18s ease,border-color .18s ease,background .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease;
  outline:none;
}
.weapon-card::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:4px;pointer-events:none;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.035);
  clip-path:polygon(0 9px,9px 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 9px),calc(100% - 9px) 100%,0 100%);
}
.weapon-card:hover,.weapon-card:focus-visible{
  transform:translateY(-3px);
  border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 60%,var(--gold));
  box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.38),0 0 26px color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 12%,transparent);
}
.weapon-card.selected{
  transform:translateY(-4px);
  border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 75%,var(--gold-bright));
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 17%,transparent) 0%,transparent 56%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(31,42,62,.92),rgba(11,17,28,.96));
  box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.42),0 0 34px color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 18%,transparent),inset 0 0 30px rgba(255,255,255,.02);
}
.weapon-card.selected::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:12px;right:12px;height:2px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--wc),transparent);
  box-shadow:0 0 16px var(--wc);
}
.w-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}
.w-icon{
  flex:0 0 auto;width:clamp(42px,4.2vw,54px);height:clamp(42px,4.2vw,54px);
  display:grid;place-items:center;padding:9px;border-radius:50%;
  color:var(--wc);
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,255,255,.07),rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%),rgba(5,8,14,.6);
  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 38%,transparent);
  box-shadow:0 0 22px color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 15%,transparent),inset 0 0 18px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
  filter:drop-shadow(0 0 7px color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 48%,transparent));
  transition:transform .18s ease;
}
.weapon-card.selected .w-icon{transform:scale(1.07)}
.w-titles{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;min-width:0}
.w-role{font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 78%,#d8cbb4);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.w-name{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,20px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#f4ecdc}
.w-key{
  margin-left:auto;align-self:flex-start;
  display:grid;place-items:center;width:19px;height:19px;border-radius:2px;
  border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.25);color:var(--gold);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;
  background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}
.w-perk{
  font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#a99f8d;letter-spacing:.015em;
  min-height:2.9em;
}
.w-special{
  font-size:9px;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#837a69;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.055);padding-top:8px;
}
.w-special b{color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 80%,#e8dcc5);font-weight:600}
.w-stats{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin-top:1px}
.stat{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.stat i{font-style:normal;font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#6e6a60;width:38px;flex:0 0 auto}
.stat b{
  display:block;height:2px;width:100%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);position:relative;
}
.stat b::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;height:100%;width:var(--v);
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 45%,transparent),var(--wc));
  box-shadow:0 0 8px color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc) 50%,transparent);
}
.title-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,38px);flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.play-btn{
  position:relative;cursor:pointer;
  padding:15px 62px;
  font-family:var(--display);font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.36em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#1c1206;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7d995 0%,#e2b45f 45%,#b9802d 100%);
  border:1px solid #f9e5b4;
  clip-path:polygon(0 9px,9px 0,calc(100% - 9px) 0,100% 9px,100% calc(100% - 9px),calc(100% - 9px) 100%,9px 100%,0 calc(100% - 9px));
  box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(217,165,74,.24),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.5),inset 0 -2px 0 rgba(110,63,11,.5);
  transition:transform .15s ease,filter .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease;
}
.play-btn::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:4px;border:1px solid rgba(70,40,5,.28);
  clip-path:polygon(0 6px,6px 0,calc(100% - 6px) 0,100% 6px,100% calc(100% - 6px),calc(100% - 6px) 100%,6px 100%,0 calc(100% - 6px));
  pointer-events:none;
}
.play-btn:hover,.play-btn:focus-visible{transform:translateY(-2px) scale(1.015);filter:brightness(1.08);box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(217,165,74,.34),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.55)}
.play-btn:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(.99)}
.play-btn.small{padding:13px 40px;font-size:14px}
.ghost-btn{
  cursor:pointer;padding:12px 26px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.3);
  color:#cbbfa9;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;
  clip-path:polygon(0 7px,7px 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 7px),calc(100% - 7px) 100%,0 100%);
  transition:.16s;
}
.ghost-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold-bright);background:rgba(217,165,74,.07)}
.controls-hint{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:7px 12px;max-width:430px;color:#8f8879;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}
.controls-hint span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}
.controls-hint kbd{height:16px;font-size:8px;min-width:18px}
.title-foot{
  margin:0;font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;color:#6d675b;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;
}
.title-foot::before,.title-foot::after{content:"—";margin:0 8px;color:#8a632a}

/* ---------- HUD ---------- */
#hud{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:10;pointer-events:none}
.hud-top{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:start;gap:20px;
  padding:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-top)) max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-right)) 0 max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-left));
}
.hp-block{width:min(285px,100%)}
.hp-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:5px;color:#d9c9a9;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase}
.hp-label span:last-child{color:#cbbfa9;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:9px}
.hp-frame{
  position:relative;height:16px;overflow:hidden;
  border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.46);
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#220d10,#160a0d);
  box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.5),inset 0 0 9px rgba(0,0,0,.8);
  clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 4px),calc(100% - 4px) 100%,4px 100%,0 calc(100% - 4px));
}
.hp-chip,.hp-fill{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:100%}
.hp-chip{background:rgba(255,209,146,.4);transition:width .5s ease .18s}
.hp-fill{
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ef6268 0%,#c6303c 48%,#851720 100%);
  box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(198,48,60,.55),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.24);
  transition:width .14s ease;
}
.hp-gloss{position:absolute;inset:1px 2px auto;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.18),transparent)}
.boon-row{display:flex;gap:5px;margin-top:7px;min-height:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.boon-pip{
  width:19px;height:19px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:4px;
  color:var(--bc,#d9a54a);background:rgba(5,8,14,.7);
  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--bc,#d9a54a) 45%,transparent);border-radius:50%;
  box-shadow:0 0 10px color-mix(in srgb,var(--bc,#d9a54a) 15%,transparent);
}
.chamber-block{text-align:center;padding-top:2px}
.chamber-label{font-family:var(--display);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#e8dbc1;text-transform:uppercase}
.wave-pips{display:flex;gap:5px;justify-content:center;margin:6px 0 4px}
.wave-pips i{
  display:block;width:22px;height:2px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);transition:.3s;
}
.wave-pips i.done{background:var(--gold-dark)}
.wave-pips i.current{background:var(--gold-bright);box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(244,208,138,.8)}
.foe-count{font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.25em;color:#847d6d;text-transform:uppercase}
.hud-right{justify-self:end;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:5px}
.stat-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:var(--display);font-size:14px;color:#e7d8b8;letter-spacing:.06em}
.stat-icon{width:13px;height:13px;color:#9a8c73}
.stat-icon.soul{color:var(--teal);filter:drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(98,227,205,.5))}
.hud-buttons{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:4px;pointer-events:auto}
.icon-btn{
  pointer-events:auto;width:30px;height:30px;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:8px;cursor:pointer;
  background:rgba(7,11,19,.7);border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.24);color:#b7ab94;
  transition:.15s;
}
.icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold-bright);background:rgba(217,165,74,.08)}
.hud-bottom{
  position:absolute;left:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-left));right:max(20px,env(safe-area-inset-right));bottom:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px;
}
.weapon-panel{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;opacity:.94}
.weapon-sigil{
  width:50px;height:50px;padding:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;
  color:var(--wc,#e2505a);
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,255,255,.06),transparent 65%),rgba(5,9,16,.72);
  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc,#e2505a) 38%,transparent);
  transform:rotate(45deg);
  filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px color-mix(in srgb,var(--wc,#e2505a) 30%,transparent));
}
.weapon-sigil svg{transform:rotate(-45deg)}
.weapon-meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.micro{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#817a6a;text-transform:uppercase}
.weapon-meta strong{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:.03em;color:#f0e5d0}
.weapon-perk{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a39986}
.ability-bar{display:flex;gap:7px}
.ability{
  position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;
  min-width:66px;padding:7px 9px 6px;overflow:hidden;
  background:rgba(5,9,16,.72);border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.2);
  clip-path:polygon(0 6px,6px 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 6px),calc(100% - 6px) 100%,0 100%);
}
.ability-key{font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--gold)}
.ability-name{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#9d9584}
.ability-cd{
  position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(3,5,9,.7);
  transform-origin:bottom;transform:scaleY(var(--cd,0));opacity:0;transition:opacity .1s;
}
.ability.cooling .ability-cd{opacity:1}
.ability.ready-flash{animation:abilityReady .35s ease-out}
@keyframes abilityReady{0%{border-color:var(--gold-bright);box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(244,208,138,.35)}100%{border-color:rgba(217,165,74,.2);box-shadow:none}}

#banner{
  position:fixed;left:50%;top:19%;z-index:12;transform:translate(-50%,-8px);
  width:min(760px,92vw);text-align:center;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;
}
#banner.show{animation:bannerShow 2.6s ease forwards}
#banner-kicker{display:block;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.44em;color:var(--gold);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:7px}
#banner h2{
  margin:0;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(28px,4.6vw,58px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#f3e8d4;text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(217,165,74,.3),0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.7);
}
#banner p{margin:8px 0 0;font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#bdb09a}
#banner p:empty{display:none}
@keyframes bannerShow{
  0%{opacity:0;transform:translate(-50%,8px)}
  12%{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
  78%{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
  100%{opacity:0;transform:translate(-50%,-8px)}
}

#toast{
  position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:max(100px,calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 86px));z-index:16;transform:translate(-50%,10px);
  padding:10px 20px;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;white-space:nowrap;
  background:rgba(5,9,16,.9);border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.42);
  color:#ecddc1;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;
  box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.5);transition:opacity .22s,transform .22s;
}
#toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}

/* ---------- reward / pause / end ---------- */
#reward-screen{z-index:24;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 42%,rgba(12,19,31,.34) 0%,rgba(4,7,12,.78) 58%,rgba(3,5,9,.96) 100%)}
.reward-wrap{width:min(980px,100%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:20px 0}
.boon-grid{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(10px,1.4vw,18px);margin-top:clamp(20px,3.4vh,38px)}
.boon-card{
  position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:9px;
  padding:clamp(16px,2.2vw,28px) clamp(12px,1.8vw,24px) clamp(14px,2vw,22px);
  cursor:pointer;text-align:center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(100% 80% at 50% 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--bc,#d9a54a) 12%,transparent) 0%,transparent 65%),
    linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(25,35,53,.92),rgba(7,11,19,.97));
  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--bc,#d9a54a) 32%,rgba(217,165,74,.2));
  clip-path:polygon(0 13px,13px 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 13px),calc(100% - 13px) 100%,0 100%);
  transition:transform .18s ease,border-color .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease;
  outline:none;
}
.boon-card::after{
  content:"";position:absolute;inset:5px;pointer-events:none;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  clip-path:polygon(0 8px,8px 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 8px),calc(100% - 8px) 100%,0 100%);
}
.boon-card:hover,.boon-card:focus-visible{
  transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:var(--bc);
  box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.45),0 0 32px color-mix(in srgb,var(--bc) 16%,transparent);
}
.boon-card .b-key{position:absolute;top:9px;left:10px;font-size:8px;color:#787062;letter-spacing:.1em}
.b-rarity{font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--bc,#d9a54a)}
.b-icon{
  width:clamp(54px,6vw,72px);height:clamp(54px,6vw,72px);padding:14px;margin:4px 0 2px;
  display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;color:var(--bc,#d9a54a);
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(255,255,255,.06),transparent 68%),rgba(3,6,11,.62);
  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--bc,#d9a54a) 44%,transparent);
  box-shadow:0 0 30px color-mix(in srgb,var(--bc,#d9a54a) 18%,transparent),inset 0 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
  filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px color-mix(in srgb,var(--bc,#d9a54a) 42%,transparent));
}
.b-name{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(20px,2.1vw,28px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#f3e9d5}
.b-desc{font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:#a9a08e;max-width:24ch}
.b-flavor{font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;font-size:10.5px;color:#6f6a5f;line-height:1.4;margin-top:2px}
.reward-hint{margin:24px 0 0;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7d7668;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
.reward-hint kbd{height:16px;min-width:17px}

#pause-screen{z-index:28;background:rgba(3,6,11,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(5px)}
.pause-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
.pause-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}

#end-screen{z-index:30;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 42%,rgba(20,12,15,.48) 0%,rgba(5,7,11,.86) 55%,rgba(2,3,6,.98) 100%)}
.end-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:24px 0}
#end-screen.won{background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 42%,rgba(24,24,14,.42) 0%,rgba(5,8,11,.86) 55%,rgba(2,3,6,.98) 100%)}
#end-screen.won #end-title{color:var(--gold-bright);text-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(217,165,74,.4)}
.end-stats{display:flex;gap:clamp(20px,5vw,58px);margin:34px 0 36px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.end-stats>div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;min-width:56px}
.end-stats span{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(24px,3.2vw,38px);color:#e9dcc1;line-height:1}
.end-stats i{font-style:normal;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.24em;color:#787165}

/* ---------- touch ---------- */
#touch-controls{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:18;pointer-events:none;display:none}
body.touch[data-mode="playing"] #touch-controls{display:block}
.joystick{
  position:absolute;left:max(18px,env(safe-area-inset-left));bottom:max(20px,calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 8px));
  width:116px;height:116px;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:auto;touch-action:none;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%,rgba(217,165,74,.09),rgba(5,9,16,.12) 64%,rgba(5,9,16,.36));
  border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.26);
  box-shadow:inset 0 0 28px rgba(0,0,0,.4),0 0 0 6px rgba(5,9,16,.18);
}
.joystick-ring{position:absolute;inset:13px;border:1px dashed rgba(217,165,74,.16);border-radius:50%}
.stick-knob{
  position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:48px;height:48px;margin:-24px 0 0 -24px;border-radius:50%;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 38% 32%,rgba(244,208,138,.34),rgba(120,85,32,.2) 55%,rgba(5,9,16,.5));
  border:1px solid rgba(244,208,138,.42);
  box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(217,165,74,.16),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  transition:transform .04s linear;will-change:transform;
}
.touch-buttons{
  position:absolute;right:max(14px,env(safe-area-inset-right));bottom:max(18px,calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom) + 6px));
  width:188px;height:176px;pointer-events:none;
}
.tbtn{
  position:absolute;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;
  border-radius:50%;pointer-events:auto;touch-action:none;cursor:pointer;
  background:radial-gradient(circle at 38% 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.09),rgba(5,9,16,.72) 62%);
  border:1px solid rgba(217,165,74,.32);color:#e9d6ac;
  box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.45),inset 0 0 18px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  transition:transform .07s ease,background .12s,border-color .12s,opacity .15s;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;
}
.tbtn svg{width:23px;height:23px;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(217,165,74,.25))}
.tbtn span{font-size:7px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#a79b84}
.tbtn:active,.tbtn.active{transform:scale(.93);border-color:var(--gold-bright);background:radial-gradient(circle at 38% 30%,rgba(244,208,138,.26),rgba(30,19,8,.8) 64%)}
.tbtn.cooling{opacity:.42;filter:grayscale(.5)}
#touch-attack{width:84px;height:84px;right:0;bottom:16px;border-color:rgba(226,80,90,.5);color:#f0a4a8}
#touch-attack svg{width:30px;height:30px}
#touch-dash{width:60px;height:60px;right:92px;bottom:0;border-color:rgba(98,227,205,.42);color:#9cebdd}
#touch-special{width:62px;height:62px;right:74px;bottom:96px;border-color:rgba(169,131,255,.44);color:#cbb1ff}

/* ---------- responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width:900px){
  .title-wrap{gap:14px}
  .weapon-card{padding:13px}
  .w-role{display:none}
  .w-perk{font-size:10px;min-height:3.1em}
  .w-special{font-size:8px}
}
@media (max-width:720px){
  .screen{padding:16px 14px}
  .title-wrap{gap:14px;padding:14px 0}
  .title-hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,15vw,68px)}
  .title-hero h1 em{font-size:.8em}
  .tagline{font-size:12px;max-width:32ch}
  .weapon-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}
  .weapon-card{padding:10px 12px;gap:5px}
  .w-head{gap:9px}
  .w-icon{width:38px;height:38px;padding:7px}
  .w-name{font-size:16px}
  .w-perk{font-size:9.5px;min-height:0;line-height:1.35}
  .w-special{display:none}
  .w-stats{display:none}
  .weapon-card.selected{transform:none}
  .weapon-card:hover{transform:none}
  .section-label{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.3em}
  .title-actions{flex-direction:column;gap:16px;width:100%}
  .play-btn{width:min(300px,100%);padding:14px 20px}
  .controls-hint{display:none}
  .title-foot{font-size:10.5px;text-align:center}
  .hud-top{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:10px;padding:max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-top)) max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-right)) 0 max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-left))}
  .hp-block{width:min(190px,100%)}
  .hp-label{font-size:6.5px;letter-spacing:.18em}
  .hp-label span:last-child{font-size:7px}
  .hp-frame{height:13px}
  .boon-pip{width:16px;height:16px;padding:3px}
  .chamber-block{position:absolute;left:50%;top:max(12px,env(safe-area-inset-top));transform:translateX(-50%);padding-top:0}
  .chamber-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.22em}
  .wave-pips{margin:4px 0 2px;gap:4px}
  .wave-pips i{width:15px}
  .foe-count{font-size:6.5px;letter-spacing:.17em}
  .hud-right{grid-column:2}
  .stat-line{font-size:11px}
  .stat-icon{width:11px;height:11px}
  .icon-btn{width:27px;height:27px;padding:7px}
  .hud-bottom{display:none}
  #banner{top:16%}
  #banner h2{font-size:clamp(25px,8vw,38px)}
  #banner p{font-size:11px}
  .boon-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}
  .boon-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:46px 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto auto auto;column-gap:12px;row-gap:2px;text-align:left;align-items:center;padding:11px 13px}
  .boon-card .b-key{display:none}
  .b-icon{grid-row:1/4;width:44px;height:44px;padding:10px;margin:0}
  .b-rarity{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.24em}
  .b-name{font-size:17px}
  .b-desc{font-size:9.5px;line-height:1.35;max-width:none}
  .b-flavor{display:none}
  .reward-hint{margin-top:14px}
  .overlay-title{font-size:clamp(32px,10vw,46px)}
  .overlay-sub{font-size:12px}
  .end-stats{gap:20px;margin:24px 0 28px}
  .end-stats span{font-size:26px}
  .title-foot:last-child{max-width:30ch}
}
@media (max-height:620px){
  .title-wrap{gap:10px;padding:8px 0}
  .title-hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,9vh,64px)}
  .tagline{display:none}
  .w-perk{display:none}
  .w-special{display:none}
  .w-stats{display:none}
  .weapon-card{padding:9px 11px}
  .w-icon{width:36px;height:36px;padding:7px}
  .title-foot{display:none}
  .boon-grid{margin-top:14px}
  .b-flavor{display:none}
  .b-icon{width:42px;height:42px;padding:9px}
  .b-desc{font-size:9px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *{animation-duration:.001s!important;transition-duration:.001s!important}
}

content.text:
Now the big game.js. Need be careful and functional. Let's write in chunks maybe full file. I'll design code.

Constants and utility.

```
(() => {
'use strict';
const $ = ...
const canvas...
const bgCanvas = document.createElement('canvas');
const ctx ...
```

Device / touch:
```
let touchUI = matchMedia('(pointer:coarse)').matches || innerWidth<820;
document.body.classList.toggle('touch', touchUI);
```

Game state object:
```
const game = {
 mode:'title', selectedWeapon:'blade', player:null, run:null,
 enemies:[], projectiles:[], effects:[], particles:[], numbers:[], pickups:[],
 spawnQueue:[], shake:0, shakeT:0, flash:0, time:0, hitstop:0,
 pointer:{x:innerWidth/2,y:innerHeight/2,moved:false,down:false},
 keys:new Set(), touchMove:{x:0,y:0}, touchAttack:false, aimAngle:-PI/2,
 bannerTimer:null, pendingBoons:[], muted:false,
}
```
But methods use game.player.

`run` fields:
```
{ chamber, maxChamber:3, weapon, souls, kills, elapsed, wave, phase, phaseT, hp? (player), maxHp, boons, buffs..., roomStart }
```
Player has hp.

Start:
```
function newRun(weapon){
 resetWorld();
 game.run = { chamber:1, weapon, souls:0, kills:0, elapsed:0, wave:0, phase:'intro', phaseT:.55, buffs:{dmg:1, speed:1, atkSpeed:1, crit:.06, critMult:2, dashCd:1, dmgReduce:0, lifesteal:0, projSpeed:1}, boons:[], chamberName:0 };
 game.player = createPlayer();
 setMode('playing');
 hideScreens(); show HUD;
 setupHUDWeapon();
 startChamber(1);
}
```
Need clear UI overlay.

`setMode` toggles body dataset, HUD hidden for title/dead/victory? HUD should be hidden on end screens maybe. Keep HUD visible while reward overlay? Hades shows. HUD visible during reward maybe nice. For pause yes. Define:
```
function setMode(mode) {
 game.mode = mode; document.body.dataset.mode = mode;
 const inRun = ['playing','reward','paused'].includes(mode);
 hud.classList.toggle('hidden', !inRun);
 if(mode!=='playing') game.pointer.down=false etc.
}
```
When dead/victory, hide HUD and show end screen. Fine.

Screens: helper `hideScreens()` loops `#title-screen,#reward-screen,#pause-screen,#end-screen` add hidden. But title screen initially visible; hide when start. On reward, show reward. On pause, show. End.

Resize + arena. Initial `resize()` before player.

Static build functions. Let's write seeding. Use custom RNG:

```
function mulberry32(a){return function(){...}}
function buildStatic(){
 const rnd = mulberry32(Math.floor(W*13+H*7));
 ...
}
```

Arena corner door: gate at top center. Since arena.y may be 100, top outside space 100. Draw from floor top up 72 px. Use arc. Let's do wall/portal:
- `gateW = min(180, arena.w*0.26)`, gateH = 100. x = arena.cx - gateW/2, y = arena.y - 76 maybe. Draw arch shape with bezier (rounded top), fill dark, inner teal gradient glow, two columns. But top screen HUD overlaps center chamber label at top 16; gate might be behind HUD, fine. On mobile, top y=96, gate from 20..110, fine.
- Draw before floor? Gate behind floor.

Floor:
- path rounded rect; fill gradient.
- clip.
- tile lines: diagonal? Let's create inlaid large rectangular slabs: grid spacing 64; draw subtle lines. Use transform? floor is top-down; diagonal slab pattern gives depth. We'll draw grid rotated 0 maybe fine. Use rows step 46, columns step 88 with offset; fill alternating alpha; stroke lines. 1200/88*700/46 ≈ 14*15=210 tiles; okay cached.
- Add random cracks 30 lines.
- central mosaic: ring + spokes + small Greek key squares; gold alpha .07.
- top light gradient from gate.
- Add edge inner shadow.
- Border: stroke 10px dark, 1px gold line inset 7.
- Brambles/roots? Add dark organic tendrils near edges.

Braziers:
- positions: maybe 4 at corners inset 44 from floor edge: {x:arena.x+42, y:arena.y+42}, {x:arena.x+w-42, y:arena.y+42}, bottom two. But enemies can overlap; purely visual. Maybe place on wall border instead: top corners y=arena.y-8, bottom corners y=arena.y+h+8; might be clipped by HUD. Let's draw standing braziers at left/right mid edges outside floor? On desktop there is space outside floor (0..arena.x), but mobile no. Simpler corners inset 38 with small 10px bowl. It adds atmosphere.
- Store flames with phase, size. Draw animated in `drawBraziers`.

Let's create `decor = {braziers:[], motes:[], gate:{...}}`.

Ambient motes: 40 particles with seeded/random values, updated each frame. We'll define `motes` array via `initMotes()` on resize; store x,y,z? Keep embers drifting.

Game loop:
```
let last=performance.now();
function frame(now){
 const raw=Math.min(0.05,(now-last)/1000)||0; last=now; game.time+=raw;
 update(raw);
 render();
 requestAnimationFrame(frame);
}
requestAnimationFrame(frame);
```
If tab hidden, dt cap.

Update:
```
function update(dt){
 updateMotes(dt);
 updateShake(dt);
 if(game.mode==='playing'){
   if(game.hitstop>0){ game.hitstop-=dt; dt*=0.08; } // still update effects with slowdown?
   game.run.elapsed += dt;
   updateSpawning(dt);
   updatePlayer(dt);
   updateEnemies(dt);
   updateProjectiles(dt);
   updateEffects(dt);
   updatePickups(dt);
   updateNumbers(dt);
   updateParticles(dt);
   updatePhase(dt);
   updateHUD();
 } else {
   // idle decay effects/particles etc for title/reward
   updateEffects(dt); updateNumbers(dt); updateParticles(dt); updatePickups(dt);
   if(game.mode==='title') updateTitleAmbient(dt);
 }
}
```
Hitstop handling: if >0, decrement and skip player/enemy updates? We can set `localDt=dt*0.12` for gameplay while effects full? Simpler:
```
const frozen = game.hitstop>0;
if(frozen) game.hitstop-=dt;
const sdt = frozen ? 0 : dt;
updateEnemies...
updateEffects full dt; particles full dt.
```
But run.elapsed should still count maybe. Do:
```
if(game.hitstop>0){ game.hitstop-=dt; dtGame=0; } else dtGame=dt
```
Effects update with actual dt so visual continues; particles freeze? Fine.

Actually title mode: draw title ambience with player? Add in render.

Input update and phase ordering: if phase transitions trigger reward overlay, stop. `updatePhase` after enemies. Need robust conditions.

Run phase state:
- `phase='intro'`, `phaseT`
- startChamber sets phase intro with phaseT .65, clears. `updatePhase`: phaseT -= dt; when <=0 startWave(1).
- startWave(w): run.wave=w; run.phase='combat'; push queue; show banner maybe with kicker "CHAMBER I" title "WAVE I" sub? For first wave maybe big "CHAMBER I" already shown by startChamber. To avoid double, startChamber shows banner "CHAMBER I / THE GILDED GATE"; startWave(1) no banner. For subsequent waves, show banner "WAVE II / The dead press in." small.
- In combat, check enemies.length===0 && spawnQueue.length===0:
   - if wave < 3: phase='wavebreak', phaseT=1.25; show banner "WAVE CLEARED"; sfx maybe.
   - else phase='cleared', phaseT=1.4; show banner "CHAMBER CLEARED"; audio.clear; maybe clear projectiles.
- wavebreak: phaseT-=dt; when <=0 startWave(wave+1).
- cleared: phaseT-=dt; when <=0 openReward() if chamber<3 else victory.
- For final chamber: after clear, open victory directly? Hades has boon then final; no need boon. Show victory after phaseT.
- `openReward()`: mode='reward'; choose 3 boons; render cards; show reward screen. Enemies zero. player stays.
- On pick: apply and:
  - hide reward, mode='playing'; if chamber<3 startChamber(chamber+1); else showVictory.
Actually reward only offered if chamber<3, so always next chamber.
- startChamber resets arrays but preserves run buffs, boons, souls, kills, elapsed. Sets player position center-ish, hp maybe preserve; chamber names.
- player hp persist. Maybe heal 15% at chamber start? Hades doesn't but for pacing yes maybe heal 10. Add "The chamber offers no mercy" but okay. Keep persistent, reward boon heal.

`startChamber(n)`:
```
run.chamber=n; run.phase='intro'; run.phaseT=.7; run.wave=0;
clear arrays except pickups etc; spawnQueue=[];
player.x=arena.cx; player.y=arena.y+arena.h*.72; player.vx=vy=0; iframes=1? (brief);
projectiles=[]; enemies=[];
showBanner(`CHAMBER ${roman}`, CHAMBER_NAMES[n-1], 'DESCENT');
updateHUD();
```
chamber names: "THE GILDED GATE", "THE WEEPING HALLS", "THE LAST THRESHOLD".

`startWave(w)` comps. Difficulty:
```
const chamberScale = 1 + (chamber-1)*.22;
let comps;
if chamber 1:
 w1 ['wretch','wretch','wretch']
 w2 ['wretch','wretch','wraith','wretch','wraith']
 w3 ['brute','wretch','wretch','wraith','wraith','wretch']
chamber 2: w1 4 wretch; w2 3 wretch+3 wraith; w3 brute2 + wraith3 + wretch4
chamber 3: w1 3 wretch+2 wraith; w2 2 brute+2 wraith+2 wretch; w3 2 brute elite + 4 wraith+4 wretch
```
Let's define function arrays. Add elite chance:
```
const elite = (chamber>=2 && i===0) || Math.random()<.06*chamber;
```
For chamber 3 final wave, make one brute elite guaranteed.
- spawnQueue entries with delay i*0.12 + rand(.08,.5) and pos from findSpawnPoint.
- `run.totalWaveFoes = comps.length` maybe track; foe count uses alive+queue.
- Show banner for w>1: `WAVE ${roman}` sub random? Maybe "The dead press in". Keep "WAVE II" and subtitle from list.

Find spawn point: arena inset 70. Try 24 times, distance from player > min(220, max(120, arena.w*.25)). Enemies spawn at edges better: choose side random (top/left/right/bottom) with random position. Good for readability. Use 65% near edges: pick side, x/y with margin. Ensure distance from player > 150. Let's use random attempts with preference edges.

Player creation:
```
function makePlayer(){
 return {
  x: arena.cx, y: arena.y+arena.h*.68, vx:0,vy:0,r:17, angle:-PI/2,
  hp:100,maxHp:100, iframes:0, dashT:0, dashCd:0, dashDir:{x:1,y:0},
  attackCd:0, attackAnim:0, specialCd:0, combo:0, comboTimer:0,
  walk:0, dead:false, hurtT:0, trail:[], dashReadyNotified:true
 }
}
```
Buffs in run. `getBuff`.

Dash:
```
function tryDash(){
